# Routing And Entrypoints

Follow `src/routes/README.md` when editing route files.

## Route file policy

- Files in `src/routes/**` should export only route declaration via `createFileRoute`.
- Do not move heavy components/business logic into route files.
- Put substantial logic/components in `actions`, `widgets`, `features`, `entrypoints`, `shared`, or `lib`.

## Generation workflow

- Route tree is generated at `src/codegen/router/route-tree.gen.ts`.
- After adding/changing route files, run `pnpm router:generate` (or `pnpm router:watch` during active route work).
- Never manually edit generated route tree files.
